.TH WLCROSSHAIRCTL 1 "2026-08-24" "wlcrosshair 1.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wlcrosshairctl \- control the wlcrosshair overlay
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wlcrosshairctl
.I command
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wlcrosshairctl
sends commands to a running
.BR wlcrosshair (1)
daemon over a Unix socket.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B toggle
Toggle the crosshair visibility.  If hidden, show it; if visible, hide it.
.TP
.B show
Force the crosshair visible.
.TP
.B hide
Force the crosshair hidden.
.TP
.B reload
Reload the configuration file and re-render the crosshair without restarting
the daemon.
.TP
.B quit
Shut down the
.B wlcrosshair
daemon and remove the overlay.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Command sent successfully.
.TP
.B 1
No command given, invalid command, or failed to connect to the daemon
(is
.B wlcrosshair
running?).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wlcrosshair (1)
